cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or the reanalysis, please cite it and the underlying GEO accessions relevant to your reuse."
title: "Cross-context reanalysis of host transcriptional responses to Chlamydia trachomatis"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
abstract: >-
  Cross-study reanalysis of publicly available human RNA-seq datasets covering
  Chlamydia trachomatis infection in epithelial and HeLa models, together with
  macrophage training comparators. The analysis evaluates differential
  expression, cross-context concordance, directional validation and preranked
  gene-set enrichment.
authors:
  - family-names: Khan
    given-names: Zaid
keywords:
  - Chlamydia trachomatis
  - RNA-seq
  - transcriptomics
  - differential expression
  - epithelial cells
  - trained immunity
  - Gene Expression Omnibus
